OL,3,GNEWSA'Agony aunt' with months to live
OL,4,Atackles bucket list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopkeeper given months to live after
OL,7,Fbeing diagnosed with terminal lung
OL,8,Fcancer said "unbelievable" support from
OL,9,Fher community had allowed her to tick
OL,10,Foff almost all the items on her bucket
OL,11,Flist.
OL,13,FClaire Bailey, who runs the Sun
OL,14,Fnewsagents in Shepshed, Leicestershire,
OL,15,Fwas told in April she had six to nine
OL,16,Fmonths to live.
OL,18,FA fundraising appeal - launched to help
OL,19,FClaire make memories with her husband,
OL,20,FRob Lord - raised #3,000 and has since
OL,21,Freached nearly #6,000.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
