OL,3,GNEWSA'Agony aunt' with months to live
OL,4,Atackles bucket list
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then, Bailey has enjoyed train
OL,7,Fjourneys, hotel stays and visits to
OL,8,Fplaces she had always wanted to see.
